{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Pixel P.I., a hacker detective who has to solve old cases to find clues about her own past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an unknown incident Pixel lost her memories, and the only link to her past is a list of old cases that she found. What's wrong with these cases? Why were they never solved? And what kind of clues do they contain about Pixel's past? These are all mysteries that <strong>you</strong> will need to solve in order to help Pixel. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game Features 6 Cases</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The axe murderer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The broken case</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The remorseful doctor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echoes of a Melody</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final case</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each case features a new set of characters that you can interact with. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Mechanics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Interrogation: You can get clues and information about the case by asking your own questions to suspects and witnesses. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Contradict: Show a clue and explain why it shows that the person is lying to force them to correct their statement. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development Status</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The early access will consist of the first two cases, the third case will be released on September and the remaining 3 will be released throughout the next months.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Becoming a P.I.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2448910/45313ac1feb5280db27cb8ecf45b386f508f98ef.jpg"},{"name":"Who killed Bernie?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/24